%%   · _AnimatedWishTree —— StatefulWidget + SingleTickerProviderStateMixin + AnimationController(duration:10s)..repeat()；仅帧号变才 setState；cacheWidth/cacheHeight 限解码 + gaplessPlayback:true；dispose 清理、vsync 后台停
